Intelligence-Driven Red Teaming
Security Research and Analysis

Key Takeaways

Completing the Red Team Threat Intelligence room strengthened my understanding of how intelligence supports offensive security operations. I learned how to analyse threat information, profile adversaries, apply the MITRE ATT&CK framework, and use intelligence to design realistic and effective red team engagements. These skills provide a strong foundation for conducting threat-informed security assessments and improving organisational resilience against evolving cyber threats.
